    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to present this impressive four-bedroom detached residence at Urcher, just outside Bailieborough. Set on a substantial and beautifully maintained mature garden, the property combines generous living accommodation with excellent outdoor space and a superb two-storey garage over basement.\r\nThe south facing gardens are a particular feature of the property, with extensive lawns, mature trees, sculpted hedging, landscaped planting, paved patios and walkways creating a variety of attractive outdoor areas. \r\nA porch leads into a spacious entrance hall, which provides access to the main ground-floor accommodation. To the left is the kitchen, complete with a breakfast nook and direct access to the separate dining room. The dining room can also be accessed from the porch , giving the ground floor a practical and easy flow.\r\nOn the opposite side of the hall are two separate sitting rooms, offering excellent flexibility for family living and entertaining. One of the sitting rooms features a solid fuel stove and double doors opening directly onto the garden. A downstairs WC completes the ground floor.\r\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, one of which is en-suite. Three of the bedrooms benefit from fitted wardrobes. There is also a family bathroom and a spacious hotpress providing excellent additional storage.\r\nExternally, the property also benefits from a substantial detached two-storey garage over basement. The upper floor has been fitted out as a games room, complete with pool table, providing an excellent additional recreational space separate from the main house.\r\nThis is a spacious and very well-presented family home with an excellent internal layout, substantial ancillary accommodation and standout gardens, all within easy reach of Bailieborough town and its many amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
