        "Content": "Stunning south facing mature gardens\r\nDetached two storey garage over basement\r\nElevated site\r\nTarmacadam driveway\r\nClose to Bailieborough town and all its amenities\r\nBER \"B\" rating\r\nWell water\r\nSeptic tank\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nSolar panel"
      },
